{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_phase_1_signal_quality", "label": "Phase 1: Signal Quality Fix (Option B Autonomy)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_mirror_collapse", "label": "Mirror Collapse", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": "## Why this phase exists", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Agents reason as if YES and NO are algebraic mirrors (per-agent |drift| 0.01\u20130.06), making the Option B \u0394Brier acceptance criterion mathematically unreachable. A signal-quality bug, not a sample-count bug \u2014 more data will not help."}, {"id": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_cluster_collapse", "label": "Cluster Collapse", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": "## Goals", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "5-agent correlated cluster (rules_lawyer/statistician/sentiment/specialist/contrarian at r 0.80\u20130.92) means the council has ~3 effective voices, not 7."}, {"id": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_shared_preamble_autonomy_rewrite", "label": "Task 1.1 SHARED_PREAMBLE Autonomy Rewrite", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": "Task 1.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three complementary mechanisms: asymmetric evidence mechanics (mirror collapse), persona-specific anchoring (cluster collapse), Bear probability-after-advocacy (Bear calibration). Anchors are first-draft direction, not settled text."}, {"id": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_persona_by_persona_rollout", "label": "Task 1.2 Persona-by-Persona Rollout", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": "Task 1.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single-shot preamble rewrite has too many simultaneous constraints; roll out rules_lawyer\u2192statistician\u2192sentiment\u2192specialist\u2192contrarian\u2192bull\u2192bear, measuring drift between stages. Bull/Bear last because they are most mirror-collapse-prone."}, {"id": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_pairwise_diversity_measurement", "label": "Task 1.3 Pairwise Diversity Measurement", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": "Task 1.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "|drift| is the individual-agent metric; pairwise Pearson is the cross-agent diversity metric \u2014 both must move. Pearson (not Spearman) keeps apples-to-apples with the retro \u00a75.3 baseline. scripts/agent_pairwise_diversity.py."}, {"id": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_option_b_backtest", "label": "Task 1.4 Option B Backtest (Conditional)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": "Task 1.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only worth running after all four unified criteria pass \u2014 running the pre-registered backtest on a still-collapsed signal is pre-registered to fail."}, {"id": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_stage_1_monitor", "label": "Stage 1 Monitor (PERSONA_V2_PREAMBLE)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": "## Session state", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "V2 preamble live since session 41; monitor passes at n=38 (1/4) and n=78 (0/4) show cluster fraction moved the wrong way (43%\u219271%, Bull collapsed into cluster); verdict deferred until n>=100, expected revert."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_phase_1_signal_quality", "target": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_mirror_collapse", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_phase_1_signal_quality", "target": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_cluster_collapse", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_phase_1_signal_quality", "target": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_shared_preamble_autonomy_rewrite", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_phase_1_signal_quality", "target": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_persona_by_persona_rollout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_phase_1_signal_quality", "target": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_pairwise_diversity_measurement", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_phase_1_signal_quality", "target": "docs_phases_phase_1_signal_quality_option_b_backtest", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/phases/phase_1_signal_quality.md", "source_location": null, "weight":